    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="0566" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Department of Defense Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Executive Secretary of the National
                        Security Council</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Souers</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Council </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-19">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">October</hi> 19, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Study of Chennault Plan by Joint Chiefs of Staff</p>
                <table>
                    <row>
                        <cell>References:</cell>
                        <cell>A. Memo for Secretary of Defense from Executive Secretary, same
                            subject, dated August 25, 1949</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>B. NSC 48 and related papers<anchor n="25a" xml:id="d572-f1"/></cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>In accord with the request of the Under Secretary of State in the reference
                        memorandum,<anchor n="25b" xml:id="d572-f2"/> the enclosed memorandum by the
                    Secretary of Defense, which includes the comments of the Joint Chiefs of Staff
                    on various aspects relating to the subject, is circulated herewith for the
                    information of the National Security Council.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sidney</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Souers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d572-a1.xml" xpointer="d572-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d572-f1" n="25a" xml:id="d572-f1-content">
                <p>The NSC 48 series dealt with U.S. Policy Toward Asia; see the regional
                    compilation in volume <hi rendition="#small-caps">vii</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d572-f2" n="25b" xml:id="d572-f2-content">
                <p>See the memorandum from Webb to Souers, August 24, <ref target="#pg540">p.
                        540</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
